{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09484","headline":"五弦行 · 韦应物","name":"五弦行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人爲我弹五弦，尘埃忽静心悄然。\n古刀幽磬初相触，千珠贯断落寒玉。\n中曲又不喧，徘徊夜长月当轩。\n如伴风流萦艳雪，更逐落花飘御园。\n独凤寥寥有时隐，碧霄来下听还近。\n燕姬有恨楚客愁，言之不尽声能尽。\n末曲感我情，解幽释结和乐生。\n壮士有仇未得报，拔剑欲去愤已平。\n夜寒酒多愁遽明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}